				{
					"id": 741140602,
					"content": "#Mr. Geisert, this is {NICKNAME}, a highly skilled adventurer.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741140603
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ms. Qiu"
				},
				{
					"id": 741140603,
					"content": "#If you plan to shoot an action film in the future, you should definitely consider casting {NICKNAME} as the lead!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741140604
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ms. Qiu"
				},
				{
					"id": 741140604,
					"content": "Haha, Ms. Qiu exaggerates. I'm not some filmmaking expert.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741140605
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Geisert"
				},
				{
					"id": 741140605,
					"content": "I'm just someone who's somewhat familiar with the uses of lighting for filmmaking.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741140606
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Geisert"
				},
				{
					"id": 741140606,
					"content": "Ah, you're too modest. The lighting in your films practically speaks for itself.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741140607,
						741140609
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ms. Qiu"
				},
				{
					"id": 741140607,
					"content": "Uses of lighting for filmmaking?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741140608
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 741140608,
					"content": "Yeah. In my lighting theory, I believe that the manipulation of lighting is the manipulation of emotion.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741140611
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Geisert"
				},
				{
					"id": 741140611,
					"content": "But... how should I put this... My theories have yet to be regarded in Fontaine's film industry.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741140612
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Geisert"
				},
				{
					"id": 741140612,
					"content": "Most directors prefer to use direct movement or the scene itself to illustrate their stories.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741140613
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Geisert"
				},
				{
					"id": 741140613,
					"content": "I've shot a few films purely using lighting transitions to express narrative, but almost no one was interested.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741140614
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Geisert"
				},
				{
					"id": 741140614,
					"content": "But now, at least one director thinks my lighting theory has value.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741140615
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Geisert"
				},
				{
					"id": 741140615,
					"content": "Director? Me? Hahaha, don't jest. I was just a tea vendor.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741140616
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ms. Qiu"
				},
				{
					"id": 741140616,
					"content": "Who said a tea vendor can't be a director? I was just a journalist before.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741140617
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Geisert"
				},
				{
					"id": 741140617,
					"content": "A journalist... Then you must be good at writing reports? Just like those in the papers.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741140618
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ms. Qiu"
				},
				{
					"id": 741140618,
					"content": "I suppose. What about it?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741140619
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Geisert"
				},
				{
					"id": 741140619,
					"content": "Huh... Just as well...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741140620
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ms. Qiu"
				},
				{
					"id": 741140620,
					"content": "Ah! Nothing, nothing. Let's eat! We will have plenty of time to work together in the future, hahaha!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741140621
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ms. Qiu"
				},
				{
					"id": 741140621,
					"content": "Everyone takes a seat to Ms. Qiu's forthright laughter.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_CONSEQUENT_NEED_CLICK_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741140622
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 741140622,
					"content": "After the meal, Ms. Qiu makes an additional meal and stuffs it in your bag after packaging it...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_CONSEQUENT_NEED_CLICK_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": []
				},
				{
					"id": 741140609,
					"content": "Is lighting very important in filmmaking?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741140610
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 741140610,
					"content": "Of course. In my theories, lighting is the key way mood is expressed in a scene.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741140611
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Geisert"
				}
			]
		},
